@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title Runtime Architecture — Local Development

top to bottom direction

actor "Clinic Staff" as User #E0F2FE

node "User Device" #F8FAFC {
  rectangle "Web Browser\nChrome / Edge" as Browser #FFFFFF
}

node "Local Machine" #F8FAFC {
  node "Frontend Dev Server\nhttp://localhost:5173" as FE #DBEAFE {
    artifact "React SPA\n+ Vite + Tailwind" as ReactApp
  }

  node "Backend API Server\nhttp://localhost:3000" as BE #CCFBF1 {
    artifact "NestJS App\n21 modules / 92 endpoints" as NestApp
    artifact "Swagger UI\nat /api/docs" as Swagger #F1F5F9
  }

  database "PostgreSQL\nlocalhost:5432\nclinic_management_db" as DB #F3E8FF
}

User --> Browser
Browser --> FE : HTTP
FE --> BE : REST API\n/api/v1/*\nAuthorization: Bearer token
BE --> DB : Prisma ORM / SQL
BE ..> Swagger : serves docs

note right of BE
JWT Guard protects all routes
except POST /api/v1/auth/login.
Roles Guard enforces per-endpoint RBAC.
end note

@enduml
